<%
  // Molecule: product card (spectsEccomerce/layouts/Product.png, spec §3).
  // White rounded card: square image, name, price with "PUNTOS" caption, and
  // the "Agregar al carrito" button (Button.png → .btn-primary).
  // Data arrives via locals — product: ProductView (id, name, price, imageUrl,
  // inStock, categories). The image fallback is already resolved by the service
  // (withImageFallback, spec §2.3) — the view adds no fallback logic.
  // data-* contract (spec §5): root carries data-product-id; the button carries
  // data-cart-action="add" + data-product-id for the future cart.js (Paso 6).
  // Stock rule (spec §6.10): !product.inStock → "Sin stock" badge + disabled
  // button (.btn-disabled).
  // Price format: the spec defines no format helper — minimal inline es-AR
  // thousands separator (mockup shows "XX.XXX" over a muted "PUNTOS" caption).
%>
<article
  data-product-id="<%= product.id %>"
  class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm"
>
  <img
    src="<%= product.imageUrl %>"
    alt="<%= product.name %>"
    class="aspect-square w-full object-cover"
    loading="lazy"
  />
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4">
    <h3 class="font-bold text-ink"><%= product.name %></h3>
    <p class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
      <span class="font-bold text-ink"><%= product.price.toLocaleString("es-AR") %></span>
      <span class="text-xs text-muted">PUNTOS</span>
    </p>
    <% if (!product.inStock) { %>
      <span class="badge badge-out-of-stock">Sin stock</span>
    <% } %>
    <button
      class="<%= product.inStock ? "btn-primary" : "btn-disabled" %> w-full"
      data-cart-action="add"
      data-product-id="<%= product.id %>"
      <%= !product.inStock ? "disabled" : "" %>
    >
      Agregar al carrito
    </button>
  </div>
</article>
